      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
## What's new

- Fixes the Input/Mic Pre layout in short windows so the left navigation pane and bottom bar remain in place.
- Adds the refreshed simulated Input and Mic Pre views used for this release.
- Sparkle scheduled update checks remain optional; you can disable them in **Device Settings › Preferences** while **Check for Updates…** remains available.

[Read the full release notes on GitHub](https://github.com/danielraffel/unofficial-symphony-maestro-mk1/releases/tag/v0.8.10)
